When
The Hosting screen raises an alert 14 days before a fee is due, again at 3 days, and marks it overdue once the date passes.
Steps
Open Finance → Hosting and filter to alerts.
Message the client contact (WhatsApp is fastest) with the amount and cycle.
Once the transfer lands, tap Collected. This issues the invoice, records the payment and moves the next due date.
If the linked vendor cost changed, update the recurring expense so profit stays accurate.
Never mark a fee collected before the money is actually in the account.', null, null, null, false, 0, '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', now() - interval '8 days', now() - interval '3 days'),
