  ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000801', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000201', null, 'Hosting fee collection', '💳', '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Newmux collects hosting and domain fees from clients on a monthly, quarterly or annual cycle. This is how we make sure nothing slips."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "When"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Hosting screen raises an alert 14 days before a fee is due, again at 3 days, and marks it overdue once the date passes."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Steps"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Open Finance → Hosting and filter to alerts."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Message the client contact (WhatsApp is fastest) with the amount and cycle."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Once the transfer lands, tap Collected. This issues the invoice, records the payment and moves the next due date."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If the linked vendor cost changed, update the recurring expense so profit stays accurate."}]}]}]}, {"type": "blockquote", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Never mark a fee collected before the money is actually in the account."}]}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Newmux collects hosting and domain fees from clients on a monthly, quarterly or annual cycle. This is how we make sure nothing slips.
